# Copy to .dev.vars for `npm run dev:api` (wrangler dev). Never commit .dev.vars.
# Any random string of 32+ characters; production uses `wrangler secret put AUTH_PEPPER`.
AUTH_PEPPER=dev-only-pepper-change-me-0123456789abcdef
# Vite's dev server proxies /api to wrangler, so allow its origin.
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173
# Uncomment to require a code when creating an account.
# SIGNUP_CODE=let-me-in
